weevils page <folder|file> "title" --kind <kind>   weevils page list|library …   weevils pages
weevils asks [open|all|stale|done]   weevils ask done|drop|open <id> ["note"]
weevils ask add "request" [--goal <id>]   weevils ask link <id> <session> ["expected report"]   weevils ask goal <id> <goal>
